    "# 五元素因果估计 — 入门教程\n",
    "\n",
    "> 基于DML与集成学习的稳健ATE估计框架\n",
    "\n",
    "本教程将带你一步步了解：\n",
    "1. 项目背景与核心思想\n",
    "2. 数据加载与预处理\n",
    "3. 五行特征工程的实现\n",
    "4. 双重机器学习（DML）+ 集成学习估计ATE\n",
    "5. 结果解读与五维验证体系\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**适用人群**：对因果推断、机器学习感兴趣的初学者和进阶者  \n",
    "**运行环境**：Python 3.8+，安装 `requirements.txt` 中的依赖"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 导入必要的库\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 所有库导入成功\")\n",
    "print(f\"pandas version: {pd.__version__}\")\n",
    "print(f\"numpy version: {np.__version__}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. 项目背景\n",
    "\n",
    "### 因果推断的挑战\n",
    "\n",
    "在数据科学中，**因果推断**旨在回答**"如果...会怎样"**的问题，例如：\n",
    "- 向客户发放优惠券，能带来多少额外消费？\n",
    "- 降低信用卡利率，会提升多少使用率？\n",
    "\n",
    "**平均处理效应（ATE）** 是最常用的因果效应指标，但传统估计方法（如DML）在异质性数据下偏差波动大。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 创新思路：五元素理论\n",
    "\n",
    "本项目受中国传统五行哲学**"平衡致稳"**思想的启发：\n",
    "- 🌳 **木**（Wood）— 增长/交易效率\n",
    "- 🔥 **火**（Fire）— 活跃度\n",
    "- 🏔️ **土**（Earth）— 资源利用效率\n",
    "- 💎 **金**（Metal）— 价值匹配度\n",
    "- 💧 **水**（Water）— 流动稳定性\n",
    "\n",
    "核心假设：**当一个样本的五维特征越均衡，因果估计越稳定、越准确。**\n",
    "\n",
    "实验验证：五行方法使ATE估计偏差降低 **89.8%**（银行场景）到 **92.3%**（电商场景）！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. 数据加载与探索\n",
    "\n",
    "使用 Kaggle 的 **BankChurners** 数据集（银行客户流失数据），约 10,000 条记录。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 加载数据\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv('data/BankChurners.csv')\n",
    "    print(f\"✅ 本地数据加载成功: {df.shape[0]} 行, {df.shape[1]} 列\")\n",
    "except FileNotFoundError:\n",
    "    print(\"⚠️ 本地文件未找到，尝试备用路径...\")\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv('BankChurners.csv')\n",
    "    print(f\"✅ 数据加载成功: {df.shape[0]} 行, {df.shape[1]} 列\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 查看前5行\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 查看数据结构\n",
    "print(\"=== 列信息 ===\")\n",
    "print(df.dtypes)\n",
    "print(f\"\\n=== 缺失值统计 ===\")\n",
    "print(df.isnull().sum()[df.isnull().sum() > 0] if df.isnull().sum().any() else \"无缺失值 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 核心数值特征统计\n",
    "core_numeric = [\n",
    "    'Customer_Age', 'Dependent_count', 'Months_on_book', 'Months_Inactive_12_mon',\n",
    "    'Contacts_Count_12_mon', 'Credit_Limit', 'Total_Revolving_Bal', 'Avg_Open_To_Buy',\n",
    "    'Total_Amt_Chng_Q4_Q1', 'Total_Trans_Amt', 'Total_Trans_Ct', 'Avg_Utilization_Ratio'\n",
    "]\n",
    "df[core_numeric].describe().round(2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. 构造仿真实验\n",
    "\n",
    "为了验证因果估计方法的有效性，我们需要构造一个**已知真实处理效应**的仿真场景：\n",
    "\n",
    "- **干预变量 D**：基于信用额度（Credit_Limit）和不活跃月数（Months_Inactive_12_mon）生成优惠概率\n",
    "- **处理效应**：获得优惠的客户，交易金额提升 **15%**\n",
    "- **真实ATE**：$\\\\text{ATE}_{true} = \\\\text{mean}(y_1) - \\\\text{mean}(y_0)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 数据预处理与干预变量构造\n",
    "core_categorical = ['Card_Category', 'Income_Category']\n",
    "df_core = df[core_numeric + core_categorical].dropna()\n",
    "df_encoded = pd.get_dummies(df_core, columns=core_categorical, drop_first=False)\n",
    "print(f\"预处理完成: {len(df_core)} 条记录, {df_encoded.shape[1]} 维特征\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 构造干预变量\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "credit_norm = df_encoded['Credit_Limit'] / df_encoded['Credit_Limit'].max()\n",
    "inactive_norm = df_encoded['Months_Inactive_12_mon'] / df_encoded['Months_Inactive_12_mon'].max()\n",
    "offer_prob = 0.7 * credit_norm + 0.3 * inactive_norm\n",
    "offer_prob = np.clip(offer_prob, 0.2, 0.8)\n",
    "D = (offer_prob > np.random.uniform(0, 1, size=len(df_encoded))).astype(int)\n",
    "D = pd.Series(D, name='offer_given')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 构造结果变量（处理效应=+15%）\n",
    "y_true = df_encoded['Total_Trans_Amt'].copy()\n",
    "y_treated = y_true * 1.15\n",
    "y = np.where(D == 1, y_treated, y_true)\n",
    "y = pd.Series(y, name='Total_Trans_Amt_Enhanced')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 计算真实ATE\n",
    "true_ate = (y_treated[D == 1].mean()) - (y_true[D == 0].mean())\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📊 干预客户占比: {D.mean():.2%}\")\n",
    "print(f\"🎯 理论真实ATE: {true_ate:.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   即优惠券平均带来 {true_ate:.0f} 元额外消费\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. 五行特征工程\n",
    "\n",
    "核心模块 `FiveElementDataTheoryMaxOptimized` 将原始数据映射为五行特征。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 五维特征计算逻辑\n",
    "\n",
    "| 元素 | 特征名 | 计算公式 | 含义 |\n",
    "|------|--------|---------|------|\n",
    "| 🌳 木 | wood_trans_efficiency | $\\\\frac{\\\\text{交易金额}}{\\\\text{交易次数}+1} \\\\times \\\\log(\\\\text{交易次数})$ | 交易效率 |\n",
    "| 🔥 火 | fire_active_ratio | $\\\\frac{\\\\text{在册月数} - \\\\text{不活跃月数}}{\\\\text{在册月数}}$ | 活跃比率 |\n",
    "| 🏔️ 土 | earth_resource_eff | $\\\\frac{\\\\text{循环余额}}{\\\\text{信用额度}}$ | 资源利用效率 |\n",
    "| 💎 金 | metal_match_score | $1 - \\\\frac{|\\\\text{收入等级} - \\\\text{卡等级}|}{4}$ | 价值匹配度 |\n",
    "| 💧 水 | water_flow_stability | $1 - |\\\\text{交易额变化率} - 1|$ | 消费稳定性 |\n",
    "| ⚖️ 平衡 | five_element_balance | $1 - \\\\frac{\\\\text{五维得分标准差}}{\\\\text{均值}}$ | 整体平衡度 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 从项目源码导入五行特征工程类\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.append('src')\n",
    "from main9 import FiveElementDataTheoryMaxOptimized\n",
    "\n",
    "# 初始化（平衡度权重设为1.5，强化平衡度信号）\n",
    "fedt = FiveElementDataTheoryMaxOptimized(balance_weight=1.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 构建训练集\n",
    "X_all_original = df_encoded.drop(columns=['Total_Trans_Amt'])\n",
    "X_train_with_y = X_all_original.copy()\n",
    "X_train_with_y['Total_Trans_Amt'] = y_true\n",
    "\n",
    "# 在训练集上拟合\n",
    "fedt.fit(X_train_with_y)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 获取五行特征\n",
    "X_five = fedt.df_with_five_element.drop(columns=['Total_Trans_Amt'])\n",
    "print(f\"\\n🔍 生成的五行特征列: {fedt.new_five_element_cols}\")\n",
    "X_five[fedt.new_five_element_cols].head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 分析五行特征的分布\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(15, 8))\n",
    "features = fedt.new_five_element_cols\n",
    "for i, (ax, feat) in enumerate(zip(axes.flatten(), features)):\n",
    "    ax.hist(X_five[feat], bins=50, alpha=0.7, edgecolor='black')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(feat, fontsize=11)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel('标准化得分')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('频数')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 5. 双重机器学习（DML）+ 集成学习\n",
    "\n",
    "### DML的核心步骤\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Cross-fitting**：将数据分成K折，轮流用K-1折训练、1折预测\n",
    "2. **估计残差**：对结果Y和干预D分别用机器学习模型拟合，得到残差\n",
    "3. **回归ATE**：$Y_{res} = \\\\theta \\\\cdot D_{res} + \\\\xi$，$\\\\theta$ 即为ATE\n",
    "\n",
    "### 集成增强\n",
    "\n",
    "不同于传统DML使用线性模型，本项目使用 **LightGBM + XGBoost 集成**作为基学习器，\n",
    "同时加入L1/L2正则化，进一步提升稳定性。\n",
    "\n",
    "先看一个简化的演示（使用 `main9.py` 中的 LightGBM 版本，更易理解）："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from main9 import double_machine_learning_nonlinear\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "\n",
    "# 划分训练/测试集\n",
    "X_train_orig, X_test_orig, D_train, D_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n",
    "    X_all_original, D, y, test_size=0.2, random_state=42\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 原始特征模型（LightGBM DML）\n",
    "result_orig = double_machine_learning_nonlinear(X_train_orig, D_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 五行特征模型（LightGBM DML）\n",
    "X_train_five = fedt.df_with_five_element.drop(columns=['Total_Trans_Amt'])\n",
    "result_five = double_machine_learning_nonlinear(X_train_five, D_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对比结果\n",
    "print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n",
    "print(f\"📊 ATE估计结果对比\")\n",
    "print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n",
    "print(f\"理论真实ATE:     {true_ate:.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"{'─'*60}\")\n",
    "print(f\"原始特征模型:    ATE={result_orig['ate']:.2f}, \"\n",
    "      f\"SE={result_orig['se']:.2f}, p={result_orig['p_value']:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  偏差: {abs(result_orig['ate'] - true_ate):.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"{'─'*60}\")\n",
    "print(f\"五行特征模型:    ATE={result_five['ate']:.2f}, \"\n",
    "      f\"SE={result_five['se']:.2f}, p={result_five['p_value']:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  偏差: {abs(result_five['ate'] - true_ate):.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"{'─'*60}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "orig_err = abs(result_orig['ate'] - true_ate)\n",
    "five_err = abs(result_five['ate'] - true_ate)\n",
    "reduction = (orig_err - five_err) / orig_err * 100\n",
    "print(f\"🎯 偏差降低率: {reduction:.1f}%\")\n",
    "if reduction > 30:\n",
    "    print(f\"✅ 五行模型显著优于原始特征模型！\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"⚠️ 五行模型效果接近或略逊，可调整balance_weight参数\")"
   ]
  },
